% may-example.l4
%
% The Logical English (for LPS) twin of the contracts of an L4 file (may-example.l4), written
% by the L4 translator (docs/migration/l4.md, step 3). Each obligation, permission or
% prohibition is a fluent that holds while it is open; the events are L4's, with the day
% L4 gives them as their last place. As L4's evaluator does, a missed deadline is
% noticed when something next happens, and that event does not count towards what
% follows. Each #TRACE of the file is a scenario; the comment above it is L4's result.
%
% DISCLAIMER. This program was written by a translator from a program of another
% system. It is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or
% implied, including any warranty that it is accurate, complete or fit for a
% particular purpose. The translation may be wrong: check it against its source
% before relying on it. It is not legal, tax, insurance, financial or other
% professional advice. Its authors accept no liability for any loss or damage
% arising from its use.

the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 5.

the events are:
    the contract prepayment option starts on day *a day*; known as contract_prepayment_option_starts.
    *a party* does prepay loan with prepayment amount *a prepayment amount* on day *a day*; known as does_prepay_loan.
    something happens on day *a day*; known as something_happens_on_day.
    *a party* does something on day *a day*; known as does_something_on_day.
    the clock reaches day *a day*; known as the_clock_reaches_day.
    the contract purchase with warranty starts on day *a day*; known as contract_purchase_with_warranty_starts.
    *a party* does make payment with payment amount *a payment amount* on day *a day*; known as does_make_payment.
    *a party* does claim warranty benefit with benefit description *a benefit description* on day *a day*; known as does_claim_warranty_benefit.
    the contract first renewal option starts on day *a day*; known as contract_first_renewal_option_starts.
    *a party* does extend lease with extension months *an extension months* on day *a day*; known as does_extend_lease.
    the contract payment with acceleration right starts on day *a day*; known as contract_payment_with_acceleration_right_starts.
    *a party* does demand acceleration on day *a day*; known as does_demand_acceleration.
    the contract conversion option starts on day *a day*; known as contract_conversion_option_starts.
    *a party* does convert to equity with conversion amount *a conversion amount* on day *a day*; known as does_convert_to_equity.
    the contract shareholder put option starts on day *a day*; known as contract_shareholder_put_option_starts.
    *a party* does exercise put option with share quantity *a share quantity* on day *a day*; known as does_exercise_put_option.
    the contract early termination clause starts on day *a day*; known as contract_early_termination_clause_starts.
    *a party* does terminate early on day *a day*; known as does_terminate_early.
    the contract warranty claim process starts on day *a day*; known as contract_warranty_claim_process_starts.

the fluents are:
    prepayment option permits *a party* to prepay loan with prepayment amount *a prepayment amount* by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_prepayment_option_1.
    purchase with warranty obliges *a party* to make payment with payment amount *a payment amount* by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_purchase_with_warranty_1.
    first renewal option permits *a party* to extend lease with extension months *an extension months* by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_first_renewal_option_1.
    payment with acceleration right obliges *a party* to make payment with payment amount *a payment amount* by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_payment_with_acceleration_right_1.
    conversion option permits *a party* to convert to equity with conversion amount *a conversion amount* by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_conversion_option_1.
    shareholder put option permits *a party* to exercise put option with share quantity *a share quantity* by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_shareholder_put_option_1.
    early termination clause permits *a party* to terminate early by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_early_termination_clause_1.
    warranty claim process obliges *a party* to make payment with payment amount *a payment amount* by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_warranty_claim_process_1.
    the contract is fulfilled; known as the_contract_is_fulfilled.
    purchase with warranty permits *a party* to claim warranty benefit with benefit description *a benefit description* by day *a due day* as its second obligation; known as o_purchase_with_warranty_2.
    the contract is breached by *a party* missing the deadline of day *a deadline*; known as the_contract_is_breached_by_missing.
    first renewal option permits *a party* to extend lease with extension months *an extension months* by day *a due day* as its second obligation; known as o_first_renewal_option_2.
    payment with acceleration right permits *a party* to demand acceleration by day *a due day* as its second obligation; known as o_payment_with_acceleration_right_2.
    warranty claim process permits *a party* to claim warranty benefit with benefit description *a benefit description* by day *a due day* as its second obligation; known as o_warranty_claim_process_2.
    warranty claim process obliges *a party* to make payment with payment amount *a payment amount* by day *a due day* as its third obligation; known as o_warranty_claim_process_3.

