% The contract prepayment option starts: its first obligations.
when the contract prepayment option starts on day a day
    and a due day = day + 365
then prepayment option permits the_borrower to prepay loan with prepayment amount 100000 by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The contract purchase with warranty starts: its first obligations.
when the contract purchase with warranty starts on day a day
    and a due day = day + 7
then purchase with warranty obliges the_buyer to make payment with payment amount 5000 by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The contract first renewal option starts: its first obligations.
when the contract first renewal option starts on day a day
    and a due day = day + 60
then first renewal option permits the_tenant to extend lease with extension months 12 by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The contract payment with acceleration right starts: its first obligations.
when the contract payment with acceleration right starts on day a day
    and a due day = day + 30
then payment with acceleration right obliges the_borrower to make payment with payment amount 10000 by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The contract conversion option starts: its first obligations.
when the contract conversion option starts on day a day
    and a due day = day + 730
then conversion option permits the_investor to convert to equity with conversion amount 500000 by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The contract shareholder put option starts: its first obligations.
