then warranty claim process obliges the_buyer to make payment with payment amount 25000 by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The first obligation of prepayment option: met, or its deadline missed.
when a party does prepay loan with prepayment amount a prepayment amount on day a day
    and prepayment option permits the party to prepay loan with prepayment amount the prepayment amount by day a due day as its first obligation
    and the day <= the due day
then the contract is fulfilled
    and it is not the case that prepayment option permits the party to prepay loan with prepayment amount the prepayment amount by day the due day as its first obligation.

